 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/hqhq1025/skill-optimizer&quot;&gt;Skill Optimizer&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/hqhq1025/skill-optimizer&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/github/stars/hqhq1025/skill-optimizer?style=social&quot; alt=&quot;Skill Optimizer stars&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: learning from real sessions to improve reusable skills.&lt;/li&gt; 
